<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Sept 27.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Sept 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO	GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   115/118   111/114     UNQ	205/208</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  118/121   121/125   208/213    220/223</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices on Friday were rangebound with some sellers seen quoting higher offers, causing buyers to be sidelined, traders said. Bunker 180-cst was indicated between $118-$121, 380-cst was quoted between $121-$125 per tonne. MDO were quoted between $208-$213 and gas oil at $220-$223.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703082)</p>
